    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/359dd5b8bc2539da5518f15bd541a3b9.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Underground Security Inc</i> is a unique blend of rogue-lite, tower defense and worker-placement elements. As a head manager of the local dungeon,<i>\u00a0</i>you are responsible for its security and profitability.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/7829f1f4cf380f677954e43530558459.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=550 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/7829f1f4cf380f677954e43530558459.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/7829f1f4cf380f677954e43530558459.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/635a064b2ea74108812d9e76ce935891.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware! you must face against waves of  &quot;heroes&quot; bent on liberating your gold. Build traps, hire minions and cast spells to repel the would-be-adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/822c10070285fcdcdb84d2797249311d.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/822c10070285fcdcdb84d2797249311d.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/822c10070285fcdcdb84d2797249311d.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/a54808bcc2d74d22ea1229335d10caf1.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your workforce of minions and assign them to complete various tasks throughout your dungeon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine</strong> for<strong>\u00a0</strong>valuable ores to add gold to your coffers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build\u00a0</strong>and <strong>upgrade\u00a0</strong>traps to improve your security</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Channel</strong> rituals for unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy</strong> minions to guard against the next wave of adventurers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/3fda4f61f2d4dacb95c0596d65b8d5f9.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/3fda4f61f2d4dacb95c0596d65b8d5f9.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/3fda4f61f2d4dacb95c0596d65b8d5f9.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d7816e3d7c3203cb0cadc710aa834476.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your minions with useful perks. Create crazy synergies to help repel against adventuring parties while appeasing your shareholders. With a multitude of minions, events, ancient tomes and buildings, each run provides a new challenge with new strategies to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d69787391a18244e5953a4988b12863d.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=528 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d69787391a18244e5953a4988b12863d.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d69787391a18244e5953a4988b12863d.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/359dd5b8bc2539da5518f15bd541a3b9.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Underground Security Inc</i> is a unique blend of rogue-lite, tower defense and worker-placement elements. As a head manager of the local dungeon,<i>\u00a0</i>you are responsible for its security and profitability.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/7829f1f4cf380f677954e43530558459.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=550 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/7829f1f4cf380f677954e43530558459.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/7829f1f4cf380f677954e43530558459.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/635a064b2ea74108812d9e76ce935891.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware! you must face against waves of  &quot;heroes&quot; bent on liberating your gold. Build traps, hire minions and cast spells to repel the would-be-adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/822c10070285fcdcdb84d2797249311d.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/822c10070285fcdcdb84d2797249311d.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/822c10070285fcdcdb84d2797249311d.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/a54808bcc2d74d22ea1229335d10caf1.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your workforce of minions and assign them to complete various tasks throughout your dungeon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine</strong> for<strong>\u00a0</strong>valuable ores to add gold to your coffers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build\u00a0</strong>and <strong>upgrade\u00a0</strong>traps to improve your security</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Channel</strong> rituals for unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy</strong> minions to guard against the next wave of adventurers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/3fda4f61f2d4dacb95c0596d65b8d5f9.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/3fda4f61f2d4dacb95c0596d65b8d5f9.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/3fda4f61f2d4dacb95c0596d65b8d5f9.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d7816e3d7c3203cb0cadc710aa834476.avif?t=1755110670\" data-has-big width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your minions with useful perks. Create crazy synergies to help repel against adventuring parties while appeasing your shareholders. With a multitude of minions, events, ancient tomes and buildings, each run provides a new challenge with new strategies to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d69787391a18244e5953a4988b12863d.poster.avif?t=1755110670\" width=528 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d69787391a18244e5953a4988b12863d.webm?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/d69787391a18244e5953a4988b12863d.mp4?t=1755110670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
